# The land, proved by walking it. Options: --seed=7 --weather=clear:0
#   tools/tour.sh tours/landscape-polish.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0
# What it holds the land to: the bonelands is cracked stone and not a tiled
# floor, at the zoom a fight is fought at as well as from above; a border
# between two landscapes is a band both of them hold ground in, not a seam;
# every ground has something to read at the zoom the game is played at; the
# moss's water is black with green edges and wears no sea foam; a village reads
# as people living in a ruin; and a crown never hides a fight, the machine's
# least of all.
hour 12
place bonelands
wait 2
shot 01-bonelands-pavement with land:bonelands
zoom 6
wait 1
shot 02-bonelands-pavement-close with land:bonelands
zoom 5
wait 1
shot 03-bonelands-at-fight-zoom with land:bonelands
zoom 15
walk 1,0 3 run
wait 1
shot 04-bonelands-walked with land:bonelands
# Borders this seed holds since a landscape stands whole on one continent (GEN 24).
# Which landscapes meet is the layout's, and it moves: the bonelands met the
# middens once and on seed 7 today meets the drowned city, the ruined
# metropolis and the scrapwood (a scan of every tile's pair, 2026-09-26). The
# drowned city is its longest border.
place bonelands-drowned_city
wait 2
shot 05-bonelands-drowned-ecotone with border:bonelands-drowned_city
zoom 34
wait 1.5
shot 06-bonelands-drowned-band with border:bonelands-drowned_city
zoom 15
place moss
wait 2
shot 07-moss-black-water with land:moss
zoom 7
wait 1
shot 08-moss-water-close with land:moss
zoom 15
village 0
wait 2
shot 09-village-noon
walk 0,1 1.2
wait 1
zoom 7
wait 1
shot 10-village-close
zoom 15
place pinewood
wait 2
shot 11-pinewood with land:pinewood
near pine
wait 1.2
shot 12-under-the-crown
zoom 9
wait 0.6
shot 13-crown-cleared-close
# The case the clearing exists for: a hostile in among the leaves, at the range
# a fight is fought at. Its own clearing opens, whatever else is about.
spawn runner
wait 1.5
shot 14-crown-cleared-for-the-machine with mob:runner
zoom 15
place snowfield
wait 2
shot 15-snowfield-keeps-the-page with land:snowfield
place burning
wait 2
shot 16-burning with land:burning
hour 23
wait 1.5
shot 17-burning-night with land:burning
